  "title": {
   "en": "Beyond Nothing"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "아무것도 아닌 그 너머"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Kim Cheong-ah has been living in a single room for two years with money borrowed from her boyfriend. I'm paying back the money little by little by working part-time at a convenience store, but it's hard to cover my expenses. I thought I was free from my abusive father, but... I want to get away from convenience stores. I want to leave my boyfriend. But I don't have the courage to do that. Will I ever be able to leave without worries? \"I told you, stop thinking about your boyfriend.\""
  },
